#: data/maps/GraniteCave_1F/scripts.inc:20
msgctxt "GraniteCave_1F_Text_GetsDarkAheadHereYouGo"
msgid ""
"Hey, you.\n"
"It gets awfully dark ahead.\l"
"It'll be tough trying to explore.\p"
"That guy who came by earlier…\n"
"STEVEN, I think it was.\p"
"He knew how to use FLASH, so he ought\n"
"to be all right, but…\p"
"Well, for us HIKERS, helping out those\n"
"that we meet is our motto.\p"
"Here you go, I'll pass this on to you.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你。\n"
"前面非常黑。\l"
"要探索的话可不容易。\p"
"刚才经过的那个人……\n"
"好像叫大吾吧。\p"
"他会用闪光，\n"
"应该没问题，不过……\p"
"对我们登山男来说，\n"
"帮助遇到的人是我们的座右铭。\p"
"来，这个就交给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/GraniteCave_1F/scripts.inc:32
msgctxt "GraniteCave_1F_Text_ExplainFlash"
msgid ""
"Teach that hidden move FLASH to\n"
"a POKéMON and use it.\p"
"It lights up even the inky darkness\n"
"of caves.\p"
"But, to use it, you need the GYM BADGE\n"
"from DEWFORD's POKéMON GYM.$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦学会秘传招式闪光，\n"
"然后使用它吧。\p"
"就算是洞窟里漆黑的地方，\n"
"也能照得很亮。\p"
"不过，要使用它，就需要\n"
"武斗镇宝可梦道馆的徽章。$"
